@startuml CollaborationVoiceRoom

'' Last example at the bottom of the forum, src: https://forum.plantuml.net/7500/how-can-i-create-collaboration-diagram

'' each of the: entity, boundary, control are the objects
'' The lines between the objects represent numbered messages
'' The <&arrrow-....> are just symbols to indicate directional linking

actor User as "user : AudioNow Customer"
boundary VoiceRoomPage as "voiceRoomPage : Voiceroom Page"
control AuthenticationService as "authenticationService : Authentication Service"
control VoiceRoomService as "voiceRoomService : VoiceRoom Service"
control AudioService as "audioService : Audio Service"
entity PodcastSession as "podcastSession : Podcast Session"

'' Trust the process, and dont look at it or it will crumble
User -> (VoiceRoomPage) : "1: openVoiceroom()\n2: joinVoiceroom()\n7: participateInDiscussion()\n11: leaveVoiceroom()\n<&arrow-right>"
(VoiceRoomPage) -down-> (AuthenticationService) : "3: verifyUser()\n4: authenticationSuccess()\n<&arrow-bottom>"
(VoiceRoomPage) -right-> (VoiceRoomService) : "5: connectToRoom()\n6: roomConnected()\n8: transmitVoice()\n9: receiveVoice()\n12: disconnectRoom()\n13: disconnectSuccess()\n<&arrow-right>"
(VoiceRoomPage) --> (PodcastSession) : "6.1: beginPodcastStream()\n6.2: streamReady()\n<&arrow-bottom>"
(VoiceRoomPage) -down-> (AudioService) : "10: adjustAudioSettings()\n<&arrow-bottom>"

'' "Almost" readable

@enduml
